WEBVTT

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.226
It took two years

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:07.976
that finally my family agreed
that my father could reconnect me

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.934
with women and girls,

00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:13.333
so they could share their problems
and together we could resolve them.

00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:17.601
So, with his blessings,

00:02:17.625 --> 00:02:21.226
I started to reconnect
with women and girls

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.667
so we could resolve
their problems together.

00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:27.601
When women show up,

00:02:27.625 --> 00:02:32.083
they bring their realities
and views with them.